Five-transistor OTA with current-mirror load
VDD vdd 0 1.8
VCM cm 0 1.0
VIN inp cm DC 0 AC 1
M1 x inp tail 0 nch W=10u L=1u
M2 out cm tail 0 nch W=10u L=1u
M3 x x vdd vdd pch W=20u L=1u
M4 out x vdd vdd pch W=20u L=1u
M5 tail vbn 0 0 nch W=10u L=1u
VBN vbn 0 0.7
CL out 0 1p
.model nch NMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=200u VTO=0.5 LAMBDA=0.1)
.model pch PMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=80u VTO=-0.5 LAMBDA=0.1)
.end
